          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "useFilter",
            "description": "Filter results with a Field:Operator:Value string, e.g. `FirstName:beginswith:Jo` or `Tags:contains:abc123`. Repeat the parameter to add more filters (`useFilter=A:eq:1&useFilter=B:gt:2`); all filters must match (AND). Field is a contact field name (e.g. FirstName, LastName, Email, City, State, Tags) or a custom field. Operator is one of: eq, ne, like, notlike, contains, notcontains, containsany, beginswith, isin, between, gt, gte, lt, lte, exists, notexists. When useFilter is used on its own, LastName honors only beginswith (a name prefix) and between (a letter range such as `LastName:between:A-M`); other LastName operators are ignored. Value may contain letters, digits, whitespace and . , _ @ / # & + -. Pattern: ([A-Za-z0-9:]+):(eq|ne|like|notlike|contains|containsany|beginswith|isin|between|notcontains|gt|gte|lt|lte|exists|notexists):([\\w\\d\\s.,_@/#&+-]*)",
            "schema": {
              "title": "Use Filter",
              "description": "Filter results with a Field:Operator:Value string, e.g. `FirstName:beginswith:Jo` or `Tags:contains:abc123`. Repeat the parameter to add more filters (`useFilter=A:eq:1&useFilter=B:gt:2`); all filters must match (AND). Field is a contact field name (e.g. FirstName, LastName, Email, City, State, Tags) or a custom field. Operator is one of: eq, ne, like, notlike, contains, notcontains, containsany, beginswith, isin, between, gt, gte, lt, lte, exists, notexists. When useFilter is used on its own, LastName honors only beginswith (a name prefix) and between (a letter range such as `LastName:between:A-M`); other LastName operators are ignored. Value may contain letters, digits, whitespace and . , _ @ / # & + -. Pattern: ([A-Za-z0-9:]+):(eq|ne|like|notlike|contains|containsany|beginswith|isin|between|notcontains|gt|gte|lt|lte|exists|notexists):([\\w\\d\\s.,_@/#&+-]*)",
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "array",
