        "description": "Billing\n\nBilling provides fields for the billing record.\n\nBilling attribute contract (PRO-5119). Comments only; no field is removed\nor renamed here.\n\nSUPPORTED (self-serve gating reads SubscriptionStatus, ProductId and\nAddonIds in app.core.waffle.get_active_subscription_items; SubscriptionId\nand StripeCustomerId are the Stripe identifiers used for billing calls):\n  SubscriptionStatus, SubscriptionId, StripeCustomerId, ProductId, AddonIds\n\nDISPLAY-ONLY (keep, but never gate on them):\n  ProductName, CreatedTime, CanceledAtTime, CancelAtTime\n\nDEPRECATED (write-only, no readers; do not add new readers):\n  BillingType, ProductDescription, BundleIds, BundleNames, AddonNames,\n  PriceIds (and Meta, BundlesLookupIds, AddonsLookupIds on BillingInDB)",
